speechtext:
The hon. member is perfectly at liberty to make any observations he wishes with respect to item 16, which after all is an administration item dealing with experimental farms service. That will certainly give him some leeway in his discussion;
TMr. Browne (St. John's West).]
but he prefaced his previous remarks by saying he would like to enter into the general discussion that took place on item 1.

There are only four that are under consideration. One is the St. Mary river; another is the Bow river;

Supply-Agriculture
another is the Red Deer and another one is the South Saskatchewan.
